      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like im just stuck in this loop. one day i'm doing okay then i mess up and the guilt just eats me alive and then i'm back at zero. it feels like i'm just running on a treadmill of misery. honestly i'm just so tired of fighting it every single day. i dont even know why i'm trying anymore.",
